  "details": "I've created and deleted multiple groups in an attempt to get a cool discriminator number like some others. Following Tupper's announcement in #open-beta-announcments regarding rate limits, I haven't been able to create any groups. When I reach the thumbs up button to create the group, it just gets stuck in a loading animation. At first I assumed \"oh well I got rate limited\" but it has been several hours and I still can't create any groups. I'm unsure if this is a bug or an intentional feature. I just thought it was strange that a rate limit prevents you from making a group for this long. Sorry if this is in the incorrect place...",
